# R93 (2026-09-11): the working lineage is paper_v5.tex; paper_v4.tex is frozen at fdd34c8 (R92-6).
# R96 (2026-09-12): the working lineage is paper_v6.tex; paper_v5.tex is the R93 close (uncommitted; read as tree 69c8d690 via --base=).
# R97 (2026-09-13): the working lineage is paper_v7.tex; paper_v6.tex is the R96 close (uncommitted; read as tree 43531d8b via --base=).
# R98 (2026-09-13): the working lineage is paper_v8.tex (the CF-2 landing); paper_v7.tex is the R97 close (uncommitted; read as tree a66254cb via --base=).
# `--tex=NAME` names another manuscript; `--base=REL` names the committed file to hash
# against (used once, when paper_v3.tex had no committed ancestor and was compared to
# paper_v2.tex at HEAD).
_TEXNAME = next((a.split("=", 1)[1] for a in sys.argv[1:] if a.startswith("--tex=")), "paper_v8.tex")
TEX = HERE.parent / _TEXNAME
REL = next((a.split("=", 1)[1] for a in sys.argv[1:] if a.startswith("--base=")),
           "iclr2027_monitoring_submission/" + _TEXNAME)

